1
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:30,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Silent Storm]</font>

2
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:31,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The city's first case</font>

3
00:01:31,870 --> 00:01:34,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of forging and selling fake VAT invoices</font>

4
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:36,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was recently decided by Chunjiang
Intermediate People's Court.</font>

5
00:01:36,760 --> 00:01:37,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The defendant, Lin Jianye,</font>

6
00:01:37,950 --> 00:01:39,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was sentenced at his first trial.</font>

7
00:02:11,760 --> 00:02:13,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Special VAT Invoice]</font>

8
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:24,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 4]</font>

9
00:02:29,190 --> 00:02:29,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou.</font>

10
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:33,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We traveled a long way
to find this place.</font>

11
00:02:33,910 --> 00:02:34,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It wasn't easy.</font>

12
00:02:35,030 --> 00:02:36,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe meeting you</font>

13
00:02:36,590 --> 00:02:37,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could make us rich.</font>

14
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:48,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I believe in fate.</font>

15
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:51,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do us a favor.</font>

16
00:02:58,190 --> 00:03:00,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give Zhou one night to think it over.</font>

17
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Yang is a fair man.</font>

18
00:03:02,870 --> 00:03:03,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One night.</font>

19
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:05,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang.</font>

20
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Admire this busty girl later.</font>

21
00:03:07,910 --> 00:03:08,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're tired.</font>

22
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:10,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's get you back to rest.</font>

23
00:03:10,150 --> 00:03:11,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Figure it out tonight.</font>

24
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:12,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tomorrow, you'll need to give our guests</font>

25
00:03:12,870 --> 00:03:13,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">an answer they're happy with.</font>

26
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He can do it.</font>

27
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:16,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That was</font>

28
00:03:16,870 --> 00:03:17,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">quite a fall you took.</font>

29
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:19,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go back and get some rest.</font>

30
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:21,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sleep well, you guys.</font>

31
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:25,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why wouldn't you listen?</font>

32
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:27,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on?</font>

33
00:03:42,310 --> 00:03:43,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We traveled a long way
to find this place.</font>

34
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:45,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It wasn't easy.</font>

35
00:03:45,630 --> 00:03:46,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I believe in fate.</font>

36
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:49,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do us a favor.</font>

37
00:03:59,150 --> 00:04:00,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is he here?</font>

38
00:04:01,470 --> 00:04:03,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And he's covered in bruises.</font>

39
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:06,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could they be forcing him?</font>

40
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:09,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The problem is,</font>

41
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:11,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he knows who we really are.</font>

42
00:04:11,710 --> 00:04:13,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If our cover is blown,</font>

43
00:04:13,750 --> 00:04:15,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we could be dead for days</font>

44
00:04:15,190 --> 00:04:16,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before the office even knows.</font>

45
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:18,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've both met him before.</font>

46
00:04:18,950 --> 00:04:20,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't think Zhou Haiyang
would betray us.</font>

47
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just because you gave him a few bucks</font>

48
00:04:23,310 --> 00:04:25,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">doesn't mean you're close.</font>

49
00:04:25,190 --> 00:04:25,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understand?</font>

50
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:27,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If this place is the hideout,</font>

51
00:04:28,190 --> 00:04:29,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then he's our best witness.</font>

52
00:04:29,950 --> 00:04:31,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We have to win him over.</font>

53
00:04:31,630 --> 00:04:32,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We don't know enough yet.</font>

54
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:34,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if we win him over,</font>

55
00:04:34,430 --> 00:04:36,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our safety comes first.</font>

56
00:04:36,270 --> 00:04:38,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're in real danger here.</font>

57
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's your plan?</font>

58
00:04:47,630 --> 00:04:48,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tomorrow, find a way</font>

59
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:49,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to leave.</font>

60
00:04:49,750 --> 00:04:51,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With things as they are,</font>

61
00:04:51,950 --> 00:04:52,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we can't leave.</font>

62
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:54,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not here just to check invoices.</font>

63
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:57,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have to keep you safe too.</font>

64
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:58,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen to me.</font>

65
00:04:59,070 --> 00:05:00,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Find a way to get out.</font>

66
00:05:00,750 --> 00:05:01,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Guangzong is too sharp.</font>

67
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:03,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The moment we leave,</font>

68
00:05:04,270 --> 00:05:04,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he'll</font>

69
00:05:05,070 --> 00:05:06,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">move everything out.</font>

70
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:08,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then we'll have no evidence at all.</font>

71
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:10,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen to me.</font>

72
00:05:10,270 --> 00:05:11,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou Haiyang</font>

73
00:05:11,070 --> 00:05:12,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is our biggest bargaining chip.</font>

74
00:05:13,510 --> 00:05:14,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm counting on him to help us.</font>

75
00:05:59,390 --> 00:05:59,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhang.</font>

76
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:00,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhang.</font>

77
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:02,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

78
00:06:02,750 --> 00:06:04,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jin, you scared me!</font>

79
00:06:04,510 --> 00:06:05,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Were you here all night?</font>

80
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:07,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're gonna open the door?</font>

81
00:06:07,950 --> 00:06:08,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

82
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:13,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never left. I fell asleep.</font>

83
00:06:14,190 --> 00:06:15,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen, I brought breakfast.</font>

84
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:16,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eat something before you head back.</font>

85
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:17,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Too late.</font>

86
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:18,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have a meeting this morning.</font>

87
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:19,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have to go.</font>

88
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:20,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good that you're here.</font>

89
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:21,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Watch the phone for me, okay?</font>

90
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:21,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

91
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:22,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Please.
- All right.</font>

92
00:06:23,070 --> 00:06:23,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I got this.</font>

93
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:26,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't work too hard.</font>

94
00:06:26,190 --> 00:06:27,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right, all right.</font>

95
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:29,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jin, I'm counting on you!</font>

96
00:06:30,270 --> 00:06:31,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take it easy.</font>

97
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:34,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Yang,</font>

98
00:06:34,390 --> 00:06:36,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">those Heidelberg presses at our factory</font>

99
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:39,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are third-generation
models we bought last year.</font>

100
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:41,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who is it?</font>

101
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go.</font>

102
00:06:48,950 --> 00:06:49,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks.</font>

103
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:51,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They print faster, too.</font>

104
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou,</font>

105
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:56,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what's wrong?</font>

106
00:06:57,510 --> 00:06:58,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come in.</font>

107
00:07:02,270 --> 00:07:03,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on in.</font>

108
00:07:08,750 --> 00:07:09,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Li.</font>

109
00:07:09,950 --> 00:07:11,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could we talk outside?</font>

110
00:07:11,870 --> 00:07:12,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's talk here.</font>

111
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:14,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're all friends here. Come in.</font>

112
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:30,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Him</font>

113
00:07:31,390 --> 00:07:32,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and him.</font>

114
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:34,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it okay to talk in front of them?</font>

115
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:35,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're friends.</font>

116
00:07:36,430 --> 00:07:37,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go ahead. Speak freely.</font>

117
00:07:44,270 --> 00:07:45,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yesterday,</font>

118
00:07:46,270 --> 00:07:47,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I got hurt.</font>

119
00:07:47,510 --> 00:07:48,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your men did this to me.</font>

120
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:49,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You admit that, right?</font>

121
00:07:50,270 --> 00:07:51,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's a workplace injury.</font>

122
00:07:51,750 --> 00:07:52,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So pay my medical bills.</font>

123
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:54,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Second,</font>

124
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:56,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when I came here,</font>

125
00:07:56,950 --> 00:07:57,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you said</font>

126
00:07:57,510 --> 00:07:59,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd just be working as a technician.</font>

127
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:02,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now you want me
to print this porn magazine.</font>

128
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:04,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's not part of my job.</font>

129
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:05,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want more money.</font>

130
00:08:08,510 --> 00:08:09,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For each day I work,</font>

131
00:08:11,480 --> 00:08:12,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want five days' overtime pay.</font>

132
00:08:15,160 --> 00:08:15,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Third,</font>

133
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:19,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if the police ever raid this place,</font>

134
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:20,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you have to testify for me.</font>

135
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:22,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't agree to this.</font>

136
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:24,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You forced me.</font>

137
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:25,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not taking the blame.</font>

138
00:08:26,390 --> 00:08:27,410
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want that in writing.</font>

139
00:08:49,510 --> 00:08:50,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gentlemen,</font>

140
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:51,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">isn't our Zhou adorable?</font>

141
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:54,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told you he has a level head</font>

142
00:08:54,670 --> 00:08:55,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and knows how to cover his own back.</font>

143
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:57,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's a real talent.</font>

144
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:58,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang,</font>

145
00:08:59,150 --> 00:09:00,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as long as you can get</font>

146
00:09:00,270 --> 00:09:01,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our guests' magazine</font>

147
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:03,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">looking its best,</font>

148
00:09:03,600 --> 00:09:06,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">all those conditions you just listed</font>

149
00:09:06,030 --> 00:09:07,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are fine by me.</font>

150
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:08,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you do it?</font>

151
00:09:10,510 --> 00:09:13,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Looks like Zhou has figured it out.</font>

152
00:09:14,750 --> 00:09:17,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As for the paper and ink,</font>

153
00:09:17,270 --> 00:09:18,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll work something out.</font>

154
00:09:18,870 --> 00:09:19,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gentlemen,</font>

155
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:21,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you've come a long way</font>

156
00:09:21,510 --> 00:09:22,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to work with our factory.</font>

157
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To get your order right,</font>

158
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:25,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll give it my all.</font>

159
00:09:26,390 --> 00:09:27,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should've said so sooner.</font>

160
00:09:28,510 --> 00:09:30,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You think you were the only one
who slept badly?</font>

161
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:32,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was worrying about our guests' order.</font>

162
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I barely slept myself.</font>

163
00:09:33,750 --> 00:09:36,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you still want compensation,
you little brat.</font>

164
00:09:36,870 --> 00:09:37,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou,</font>

165
00:09:38,150 --> 00:09:40,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that third condition of yours,</font>

166
00:09:40,150 --> 00:09:42,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about the police raiding this place,</font>

167
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that'll never happen.</font>

168
00:09:43,910 --> 00:09:45,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The cop who could find this place</font>

169
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:47,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">hasn't even graduated yet.</font>

170
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:50,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Relax. Here, have an egg.</font>

171
00:09:50,270 --> 00:09:51,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't jinx us.</font>

172
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:53,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, sit down.</font>

173
00:09:54,150 --> 00:09:54,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have some breakfast.</font>

174
00:09:55,150 --> 00:09:57,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then take our guests to the workshop.</font>

175
00:09:57,360 --> 00:09:59,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Chunjiang Tax Bureau]
Chunjiang Tax Bureau has recently</font>

176
00:09:59,150 --> 00:10:00,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Chunjiang Tax Bureau]
started cracking down on</font>

177
00:10:00,670 --> 00:10:02,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">invoice forgery,
illegal resale and theft,</font>

178
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:05,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">solving a major case.</font>

179
00:10:05,790 --> 00:10:06,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dahang Printing Factory's</font>

180
00:10:06,870 --> 00:10:09,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">ringleader, Lin Jianye,</font>

181
00:10:09,550 --> 00:10:10,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has had his death sentence approved</font>

182
00:10:11,870 --> 00:10:12,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">by the Supreme People's Court.</font>

183
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This has sent a strong warning</font>

184
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:17,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to criminals still at large.</font>

185
00:10:17,870 --> 00:10:18,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But</font>

186
00:10:18,510 --> 00:10:21,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">some won't stop until it's too late.</font>

187
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:22,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They may even see
the crackdown as a chance</font>

188
00:10:23,390 --> 00:10:25,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to make even more dirty money.</font>

189
00:10:25,790 --> 00:10:27,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A single counterfeit invoice</font>

190
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can be used to evade taxes</font>

191
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:32,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">worth tens, hundreds,
thousands, even millions.</font>

192
00:10:32,910 --> 00:10:34,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Jianye sold at least</font>

193
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:35,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">tens of thousands of fake invoices,</font>

194
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:36,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">costing the country</font>

195
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:38,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">hundreds of millions in tax revenue.</font>

196
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:38,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Comrades,</font>

197
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:41,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">these people are parasites
on our nation.</font>

198
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:44,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We must put an end to this crime.</font>

199
00:10:59,080 --> 00:10:59,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here we are.</font>

200
00:11:00,670 --> 00:11:01,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gentlemen,</font>

201
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:04,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this is our printing workshop.</font>

202
00:11:05,510 --> 00:11:06,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry about that.</font>

203
00:11:07,630 --> 00:11:08,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou,</font>

204
00:11:08,670 --> 00:11:10,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">show our guests around inside.</font>

205
00:11:11,030 --> 00:11:11,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

206
00:11:13,270 --> 00:11:13,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This way.</font>

207
00:11:14,670 --> 00:11:16,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry, our security is very tight.</font>

208
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not even a fly can get in.</font>

209
00:11:19,480 --> 00:11:20,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is our production line.</font>

210
00:11:21,270 --> 00:11:22,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't underestimate</font>

211
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:23,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this paper.</font>

212
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:25,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's all high-quality paper.</font>

213
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:26,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These two machines are imported.</font>

214
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:28,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There aren't many in all of Chunjiang.</font>

215
00:11:29,510 --> 00:11:30,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Liu,</font>

216
00:11:30,670 --> 00:11:31,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have Zhou</font>

217
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:33,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">show our guests around the factory.</font>

218
00:11:33,790 --> 00:11:34,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's have a word.</font>

219
00:11:38,910 --> 00:11:39,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're guests.</font>

220
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:41,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold on.</font>

221
00:11:47,390 --> 00:11:48,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Liu, do me a favor.</font>

222
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:56,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

223
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:57,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Heidelbergs are just inside.</font>

224
00:11:57,670 --> 00:11:58,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There are several.</font>

225
00:12:00,390 --> 00:12:01,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

226
00:12:01,870 --> 00:12:02,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou,</font>

227
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:04,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">look after our guests.</font>

228
00:12:10,670 --> 00:12:11,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bingren,</font>

229
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:13,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sorry about that day.</font>

230
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:16,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was all an act for Zhou Haiyang.</font>

231
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:19,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I needed to win him over,
you understand.</font>

232
00:12:19,630 --> 00:12:20,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong already called.</font>

233
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:22,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She ordered a shutdown.</font>

234
00:12:22,550 --> 00:12:23,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The island's closed for a few days.</font>

235
00:12:24,550 --> 00:12:25,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know.</font>

236
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:26,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just hadn't had a chance
to tell you yet.</font>

237
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:28,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So it's sealed off. So what?</font>

238
00:12:28,150 --> 00:12:29,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not the first time.</font>

239
00:12:29,390 --> 00:12:31,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can ramp up production.</font>

240
00:12:31,670 --> 00:12:32,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good.</font>

241
00:12:33,080 --> 00:12:33,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good.</font>

242
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:35,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How do we split the money?</font>

243
00:12:36,550 --> 00:12:37,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, as for the money...</font>

244
00:12:37,910 --> 00:12:39,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's do it the usual way.</font>

245
00:12:40,150 --> 00:12:40,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seventy-thirty, in my favor.</font>

246
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:42,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not this time.</font>

247
00:12:42,030 --> 00:12:43,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, I need cash fast.</font>

248
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:43,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhao,</font>

249
00:12:46,080 --> 00:12:47,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have you released that news yet?</font>

250
00:12:47,910 --> 00:12:49,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Worried about your star pupil's safety?</font>

251
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:51,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can I not be worried?</font>

252
00:12:51,390 --> 00:12:53,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I still can't reach them.</font>

253
00:12:53,270 --> 00:12:54,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If that news gets out,</font>

254
00:12:54,630 --> 00:12:55,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they'll be in serious danger.</font>

255
00:12:55,910 --> 00:12:57,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's a smart kid.</font>

256
00:12:57,150 --> 00:12:57,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He'll be fine.</font>

257
00:12:58,390 --> 00:13:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me know as soon as
you hear anything.</font>

258
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:02,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll have the police</font>

259
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:03,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">rescue them right away.</font>

260
00:13:04,030 --> 00:13:04,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

261
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:06,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here are some samples</font>

262
00:13:06,630 --> 00:13:07,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of our print work.</font>

263
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:11,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These calendars, for example.</font>

264
00:13:11,390 --> 00:13:12,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take a look at this paper.</font>

265
00:13:12,550 --> 00:13:14,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this the kind you're looking for?</font>

266
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:16,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What kind of paper is this?</font>

267
00:13:17,080 --> 00:13:18,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is coated paper,</font>

268
00:13:18,550 --> 00:13:19,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">128 gsm.</font>

269
00:13:19,550 --> 00:13:21,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's very good quality.</font>

270
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:23,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is there anything better?</font>

271
00:13:23,270 --> 00:13:23,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

272
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:26,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That one's 157 gsm coated paper.</font>

273
00:13:26,870 --> 00:13:28,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That one costs more.</font>

274
00:13:29,390 --> 00:13:32,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">157 gsm sounds good. Let's see it.</font>

275
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:33,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We want to see the best.</font>

276
00:13:33,750 --> 00:13:34,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

277
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:37,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's in the warehouse.</font>

278
00:13:37,360 --> 00:13:38,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will you take us to see it,</font>

279
00:13:39,270 --> 00:13:40,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or what?</font>

280
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:45,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two,</font>

281
00:13:45,510 --> 00:13:46,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">go to the warehouse</font>

282
00:13:46,750 --> 00:13:48,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and get some 157 gsm paper</font>

283
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:49,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to show our guests.</font>

284
00:13:56,080 --> 00:13:56,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You stay here.</font>

285
00:14:04,630 --> 00:14:07,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A Heidelberg.</font>

286
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Impressive.</font>

287
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:15,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This even flips up.</font>

288
00:14:16,270 --> 00:14:17,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, please don't touch that.</font>

289
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:19,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a very expensive machine.</font>

290
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:20,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- You break it, you pay.
- Can't I touch it?</font>

291
00:14:20,550 --> 00:14:22,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It won't break.</font>

292
00:14:22,030 --> 00:14:24,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not going to fall apart.</font>

293
00:14:24,360 --> 00:14:25,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's very expensive.</font>

294
00:14:25,080 --> 00:14:26,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It won't break that easily.</font>

295
00:14:26,240 --> 00:14:27,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a Heidelberg.</font>

296
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:28,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cheapskate.</font>

297
00:14:28,480 --> 00:14:30,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be so stingy.</font>

298
00:14:30,320 --> 00:14:31,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're business partners.</font>

299
00:14:31,550 --> 00:14:32,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't wander off.</font>

300
00:14:36,670 --> 00:14:37,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Impressive.</font>

301
00:14:38,030 --> 00:14:39,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A Heidelberg.</font>

302
00:14:39,270 --> 00:14:40,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't touch those buttons.</font>

303
00:14:43,750 --> 00:14:44,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey!</font>

304
00:14:44,360 --> 00:14:45,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell him to leave it alone.</font>

305
00:14:45,750 --> 00:14:46,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't touch that.</font>

306
00:14:46,480 --> 00:14:47,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm just trying it out.</font>

307
00:14:47,790 --> 00:14:49,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How do I know this machine</font>

308
00:14:49,080 --> 00:14:50,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">isn't a knockoff?</font>

309
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:51,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me see if it works.</font>

310
00:14:51,390 --> 00:14:52,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang.</font>

311
00:14:53,270 --> 00:14:54,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know why we're here, right?</font>

312
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:55,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can't even touch it?</font>

313
00:14:55,510 --> 00:14:57,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this where they print fake invoices?</font>

314
00:14:57,600 --> 00:14:59,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine, I won't touch it.</font>

315
00:15:00,720 --> 00:15:01,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then why are you here?</font>

316
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:04,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They tricked me into coming here.</font>

317
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:05,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I found out, I tried to escape.</font>

318
00:15:05,750 --> 00:15:07,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They caught me and beat me up.</font>

319
00:15:09,270 --> 00:15:10,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where do they keep
the electrotype plate?</font>

320
00:15:10,670 --> 00:15:11,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They locked up the invoices</font>

321
00:15:11,720 --> 00:15:12,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the electrotype plate.</font>

322
00:15:12,630 --> 00:15:13,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know where they are.</font>

323
00:15:13,910 --> 00:15:15,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But if you arrest them,</font>

324
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:16,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can testify.</font>

325
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:18,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be your witness.</font>

326
00:15:18,030 --> 00:15:19,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That still won't be enough.</font>

327
00:15:21,600 --> 00:15:22,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang,</font>

328
00:15:22,670 --> 00:15:23,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can trust you,</font>

329
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:24,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right?</font>

330
00:15:25,120 --> 00:15:26,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two helped me.</font>

331
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:28,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I owe you one.</font>

332
00:15:28,550 --> 00:15:29,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want this.</font>

333
00:15:30,030 --> 00:15:31,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get out of here while you can.</font>

334
00:15:31,080 --> 00:15:32,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This island is dangerous.</font>

335
00:15:32,150 --> 00:15:33,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're capable of murder.</font>

336
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:35,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get police backup and arrest them.</font>

337
00:15:36,630 --> 00:15:37,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry.</font>

338
00:15:37,480 --> 00:15:37,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Zhao.</font>

339
00:15:37,790 --> 00:15:38,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He is here.</font>

340
00:15:38,480 --> 00:15:40,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell them the cost is too high.</font>

341
00:15:40,270 --> 00:15:41,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then get off this island.</font>

342
00:15:41,240 --> 00:15:41,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is the paper any good?</font>

343
00:15:41,910 --> 00:15:43,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Too expensive. Too expensive.</font>

344
00:15:44,750 --> 00:15:46,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll be back for you. Stay safe.</font>

345
00:15:46,630 --> 00:15:47,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then there's nothing to discuss.</font>

346
00:15:48,510 --> 00:15:49,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong, Mr. Yang?</font>

347
00:15:49,030 --> 00:15:49,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao,</font>

348
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:51,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you came at the right time.</font>

349
00:15:51,030 --> 00:15:52,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our printing costs are
high enough already.</font>

350
00:15:52,790 --> 00:15:53,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

351
00:15:54,150 --> 00:15:55,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This Mr. Zhou of yours</font>

352
00:15:55,670 --> 00:15:57,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">doubled the price.</font>

353
00:15:58,550 --> 00:15:59,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened?</font>

354
00:15:59,790 --> 00:16:02,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They want the inside pages printed</font>

355
00:16:02,870 --> 00:16:03,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on 157 gsm paper, too.</font>

356
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:04,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If that's the case,</font>

357
00:16:04,790 --> 00:16:05,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it'll cost 20 yuan.</font>

358
00:16:05,790 --> 00:16:07,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At that price,</font>

359
00:16:07,550 --> 00:16:09,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I might as well sell the original.</font>

360
00:16:09,080 --> 00:16:10,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Exactly.
- I understand. It's fine.</font>

361
00:16:10,670 --> 00:16:11,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Li,</font>

362
00:16:12,270 --> 00:16:13,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we're here on business.</font>

363
00:16:13,750 --> 00:16:15,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We still have to get approval</font>

364
00:16:16,030 --> 00:16:17,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for this price.</font>

365
00:16:17,080 --> 00:16:17,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I get it.</font>

366
00:16:17,480 --> 00:16:19,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're trying to make a profit here.</font>

367
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:20,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Zhou can find a way.</font>

368
00:16:20,720 --> 00:16:21,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I can't.</font>

369
00:16:21,630 --> 00:16:22,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- I can't do it.
- Mr. Li,</font>

370
00:16:22,750 --> 00:16:23,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">perhaps another time.</font>

371
00:16:23,790 --> 00:16:24,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Mr. Zhou can do it.
- Let's go.</font>

372
00:16:25,120 --> 00:16:26,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can do it, right, Mr. Zhou?</font>

373
00:16:26,320 --> 00:16:27,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Come on, let's go.
- Hear me out.</font>

374
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:30,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your own technician
says it can't be done.</font>

375
00:16:30,720 --> 00:16:31,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It can be done.</font>

376
00:16:31,720 --> 00:16:33,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You dragged me here for nothing.</font>

377
00:16:36,910 --> 00:16:38,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who told you to run your mouth?</font>

378
00:16:38,510 --> 00:16:39,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They asked me.</font>

379
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:40,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I said print it. So print it!</font>

380
00:16:50,320 --> 00:16:51,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take us off the island.</font>

381
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:01,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you messing with me?</font>

382
00:17:02,790 --> 00:17:04,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were the ones in a hurry
to see the factory,</font>

383
00:17:04,960 --> 00:17:06,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and now you're rushing to leave.</font>

384
00:17:06,510 --> 00:17:08,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You think you can come
and go as you please?</font>

385
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:10,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is this, a zoo?</font>

386
00:17:11,480 --> 00:17:12,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao.</font>

387
00:17:14,240 --> 00:17:15,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you mean?</font>

388
00:17:16,790 --> 00:17:18,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you two mean?</font>

389
00:17:18,920 --> 00:17:20,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want to leave? Fine.</font>

390
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:22,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've got arms and legs.</font>

391
00:17:22,750 --> 00:17:23,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Swim back yourselves.</font>

392
00:17:24,110 --> 00:17:25,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Playing games with us?</font>

393
00:17:25,510 --> 00:17:26,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think you've got us over a barrel?</font>

394
00:17:27,110 --> 00:17:28,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

395
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:29,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you.</font>

396
00:17:30,590 --> 00:17:31,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can send you off,</font>

397
00:17:32,550 --> 00:17:33,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but the money stays.</font>

398
00:17:34,030 --> 00:17:35,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your deposit stays as security.</font>

399
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:38,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The money is right here.</font>

400
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you've got the guts, take it.</font>

401
00:17:43,590 --> 00:17:45,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cash on delivery.</font>

402
00:17:45,880 --> 00:17:47,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's the rule of the trade.</font>

403
00:17:47,920 --> 00:17:48,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gentlemen.</font>

404
00:17:48,790 --> 00:17:49,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well...</font>

405
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:50,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think Mr. Li has a point.</font>

406
00:17:50,960 --> 00:17:51,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if you leave the money</font>

407
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:52,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">here for now,</font>

408
00:17:52,720 --> 00:17:53,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with Mr. Li for safekeeping?</font>

409
00:17:54,200 --> 00:17:55,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can go back and talk it over.</font>

410
00:17:55,920 --> 00:17:57,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll try to bring the costs down,</font>

411
00:17:57,510 --> 00:17:57,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">okay?</font>

412
00:17:58,640 --> 00:18:00,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not your place to speak.</font>

413
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:03,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Li.</font>

414
00:18:04,160 --> 00:18:05,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no. Guangzong.</font>

415
00:18:05,880 --> 00:18:06,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guangzong.</font>

416
00:18:06,680 --> 00:18:07,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's not burn bridges.</font>

417
00:18:08,160 --> 00:18:08,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's no need.</font>

418
00:18:10,070 --> 00:18:11,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's too late for that.</font>

419
00:18:29,720 --> 00:18:30,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">100,000.</font>

420
00:18:31,830 --> 00:18:32,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">100,000.</font>

421
00:18:33,550 --> 00:18:35,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">100,000! 100,000!</font>

422
00:18:35,790 --> 00:18:37,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Trying to act rich in front of me?</font>

423
00:18:38,590 --> 00:18:39,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A hundred thousand</font>

424
00:18:40,270 --> 00:18:42,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is more than you deserve.</font>

425
00:18:42,440 --> 00:18:44,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who carries half a million in cash?</font>

426
00:18:44,880 --> 00:18:46,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">100,000 Hong Kong dollars.</font>

427
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:48,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that not good enough for you?</font>

428
00:18:50,480 --> 00:18:51,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Got any more?</font>

429
00:18:51,640 --> 00:18:52,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll give you one more chance.</font>

430
00:18:52,680 --> 00:18:53,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Any more money?</font>

431
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:55,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've got plenty in the bank.</font>

432
00:18:55,480 --> 00:18:56,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Close the deal and you'll get paid.</font>

433
00:18:56,830 --> 00:18:57,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They have money, Guangzong.</font>

434
00:18:58,240 --> 00:18:59,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ask them for proof of funds.</font>

435
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:01,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Proof of funds.</font>

436
00:19:02,590 --> 00:19:03,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

437
00:19:03,880 --> 00:19:04,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which bank?</font>

438
00:19:05,830 --> 00:19:06,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have your people</font>

439
00:19:06,680 --> 00:19:08,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">get your bank statements.</font>

440
00:19:08,640 --> 00:19:09,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My people will check them.</font>

441
00:19:10,830 --> 00:19:12,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on, make the call.</font>

442
00:19:29,750 --> 00:19:33,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">9082342.</font>

443
00:19:34,240 --> 00:19:37,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">9082342.</font>

444
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:38,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Captain Zhang,</font>

445
00:19:39,350 --> 00:19:40,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Chunjiang Tax Bureau]
phone for you!</font>

446
00:19:41,830 --> 00:19:42,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhang!</font>

447
00:19:43,550 --> 00:19:44,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Coming!</font>

448
00:19:46,400 --> 00:19:47,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhang!</font>

449
00:19:47,830 --> 00:19:49,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's the hurry, Captain Zhang?</font>

450
00:19:49,350 --> 00:19:50,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Coming!
- Phone for you!</font>

451
00:19:50,480 --> 00:19:51,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Coming!</font>

452
00:19:51,510 --> 00:19:52,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's a call for you.</font>

453
00:19:53,550 --> 00:19:54,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's the number?</font>

454
00:19:54,510 --> 00:19:56,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">9082342.</font>

455
00:19:56,920 --> 00:19:58,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">9082342.</font>

456
00:19:58,200 --> 00:19:58,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right.</font>

457
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:09,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're playing me. You're playing me!</font>

458
00:20:09,310 --> 00:20:10,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You think you can fool me?</font>

459
00:20:10,590 --> 00:20:11,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- You're playing me!
- Again.</font>

460
00:20:11,350 --> 00:20:12,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give them some time.</font>

461
00:20:12,200 --> 00:20:13,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Try again.</font>

462
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:14,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two, try again.</font>

463
00:20:36,640 --> 00:20:37,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guangzong, give them some time.</font>

464
00:20:39,350 --> 00:20:40,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The call's come through!</font>

465
00:20:41,350 --> 00:20:42,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold on!</font>

466
00:20:43,480 --> 00:20:44,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait, wait.</font>

467
00:21:05,720 --> 00:21:06,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello? Zhang.</font>

468
00:21:06,920 --> 00:21:08,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello? Where are you?</font>

469
00:21:09,030 --> 00:21:10,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What took you so long to answer?</font>

470
00:21:11,030 --> 00:21:12,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Out riding that broken
bike of yours again?</font>

471
00:21:14,750 --> 00:21:15,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello?</font>

472
00:21:16,400 --> 00:21:17,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Speak up a little.</font>

473
00:21:18,640 --> 00:21:19,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm surrounded by water.</font>

474
00:21:20,160 --> 00:21:21,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The signal's terrible.</font>

475
00:21:21,160 --> 00:21:22,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no, boss.</font>

476
00:21:22,640 --> 00:21:24,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, calm down.</font>

477
00:21:24,830 --> 00:21:27,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're... on an island?</font>

478
00:21:27,880 --> 00:21:29,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do you care where I am?</font>

479
00:21:29,960 --> 00:21:30,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's the thing.</font>

480
00:21:30,790 --> 00:21:32,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's urgent. I need proof of funds.</font>

481
00:21:33,590 --> 00:21:34,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Within one hour,</font>

482
00:21:35,350 --> 00:21:37,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">go to the Juben branch of ICBC</font>

483
00:21:37,110 --> 00:21:38,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and get proof of my bank balance.</font>

484
00:21:38,720 --> 00:21:40,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone will come to see you.</font>

485
00:21:40,510 --> 00:21:41,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Show them we've got the money.</font>

486
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:43,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you understand?</font>

487
00:21:44,510 --> 00:21:45,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, okay.</font>

488
00:21:45,480 --> 00:21:46,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understood.</font>

489
00:21:47,880 --> 00:21:48,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Boss.</font>

490
00:21:48,790 --> 00:21:50,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello? Boss? Hello?</font>

491
00:21:57,590 --> 00:21:58,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On an island...</font>

492
00:21:58,240 --> 00:21:59,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll give you one more hour.</font>

493
00:21:59,720 --> 00:22:00,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Either leave the money,</font>

494
00:22:02,070 --> 00:22:02,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or you won't leave alive.</font>

495
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:04,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine. It's fine.</font>

496
00:22:05,270 --> 00:22:06,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One hour.</font>

497
00:22:07,110 --> 00:22:08,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've got one hour.</font>

498
00:22:09,590 --> 00:22:10,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's all right.</font>

499
00:22:10,440 --> 00:22:10,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One hour.</font>

500
00:22:10,920 --> 00:22:11,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay out of trouble.</font>

501
00:22:14,400 --> 00:22:14,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhao.</font>

502
00:22:15,310 --> 00:22:16,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry, hurry!</font>

503
00:22:16,640 --> 00:22:17,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've found him!</font>

504
00:22:18,270 --> 00:22:18,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who did you find?</font>

505
00:22:19,000 --> 00:22:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's get him out of there.</font>

506
00:22:20,070 --> 00:22:20,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouyang Xu?</font>

507
00:22:27,550 --> 00:22:28,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will they get the message?</font>

508
00:22:28,550 --> 00:22:29,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will they know what to do?</font>

509
00:22:31,880 --> 00:22:33,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I trust my master and the tax bureau.</font>

510
00:22:33,200 --> 00:22:33,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They won't let us down.</font>

511
00:22:34,440 --> 00:22:35,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I trust them, too.</font>

512
00:22:35,680 --> 00:22:38,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[ICBC]</font>

513
00:22:44,240 --> 00:22:44,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look closely.</font>

514
00:22:45,830 --> 00:22:47,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Count the zeros.</font>

515
00:22:47,480 --> 00:22:48,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One, two, three, four, five...</font>

516
00:22:49,790 --> 00:22:50,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Six zeros.</font>

517
00:22:54,030 --> 00:22:54,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Five million.</font>

518
00:23:00,790 --> 00:23:02,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guangzong, I've seen it.</font>

519
00:23:02,160 --> 00:23:02,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How much?</font>

520
00:23:02,960 --> 00:23:04,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So many zeros. Five million!</font>

521
00:23:04,400 --> 00:23:06,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Supreme People's Court</font>

522
00:23:06,720 --> 00:23:07,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and three other agencies</font>

523
00:23:08,240 --> 00:23:10,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">issued a joint notice
on a campaign against</font>

524
00:23:10,110 --> 00:23:12,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">invoice forgery,
illegal resale and theft.</font>

525
00:23:13,590 --> 00:23:15,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The city's first case</font>

526
00:23:15,680 --> 00:23:18,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of forging and selling fake VAT invoices</font>

527
00:23:19,240 --> 00:23:21,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was recently decided by Chunjiang
Intermediate People's Court.</font>

528
00:23:22,110 --> 00:23:22,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guangzong.</font>

529
00:23:22,640 --> 00:23:24,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Jianye was sentenced
at his first trial.</font>

530
00:23:24,550 --> 00:23:25,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is bad.</font>

531
00:23:40,400 --> 00:23:41,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's Zhou?</font>

532
00:23:42,160 --> 00:23:42,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Over there.</font>

533
00:23:54,000 --> 00:23:54,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You print it.</font>

534
00:23:57,070 --> 00:23:57,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Li.</font>

535
00:23:58,480 --> 00:23:59,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know Lin Jianye?</font>

536
00:24:01,680 --> 00:24:02,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you asking?</font>

537
00:24:03,510 --> 00:24:05,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just heard on the radio</font>

538
00:24:05,720 --> 00:24:08,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that Lin Jianye got the death penalty
for printing fake invoices.</font>

539
00:24:08,550 --> 00:24:10,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We print fake invoices too, right?</font>

540
00:24:10,790 --> 00:24:12,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What does this have to do with you?</font>

541
00:24:12,550 --> 00:24:13,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's it got to do with me?</font>

542
00:24:13,640 --> 00:24:15,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The police are bound to crack down now.</font>

543
00:24:15,720 --> 00:24:16,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If they crack down,</font>

544
00:24:16,350 --> 00:24:18,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we could all face the death penalty.</font>

545
00:24:18,790 --> 00:24:19,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you,</font>

546
00:24:20,030 --> 00:24:21,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">cut the nonsense.</font>

547
00:24:21,640 --> 00:24:22,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This island is safe.</font>

548
00:24:22,750 --> 00:24:23,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're stuck on an island.</font>

549
00:24:24,000 --> 00:24:25,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If the police come,</font>

550
00:24:25,270 --> 00:24:26,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'll be sitting ducks.</font>

551
00:24:26,310 --> 00:24:27,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">None of us will get away.</font>

552
00:24:27,960 --> 00:24:29,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guangzong, you should run now.</font>

553
00:24:30,480 --> 00:24:31,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

554
00:24:31,640 --> 00:24:32,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll follow you.</font>

555
00:24:32,350 --> 00:24:33,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wherever you go, I'll go.</font>

556
00:24:33,680 --> 00:24:34,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll make money somewhere else.</font>

557
00:24:36,400 --> 00:24:36,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay.</font>

558
00:24:37,480 --> 00:24:38,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

559
00:24:38,200 --> 00:24:38,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So when do we leave?</font>

560
00:24:40,440 --> 00:24:41,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be honest with you.</font>

561
00:24:41,750 --> 00:24:42,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really need this money.</font>

562
00:24:43,640 --> 00:24:45,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haiyang, please help me.</font>

563
00:24:45,720 --> 00:24:46,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My mom has been kidnapped.</font>

564
00:24:46,680 --> 00:24:47,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're going to kill her.</font>

565
00:24:47,680 --> 00:24:48,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry about the cost.</font>

566
00:24:48,640 --> 00:24:49,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just tell me,</font>

567
00:24:49,510 --> 00:24:51,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how long to print the magazine?</font>

568
00:24:51,350 --> 00:24:53,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Calm down. Let me think.</font>

569
00:24:56,070 --> 00:24:56,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seven days.</font>

570
00:24:56,720 --> 00:24:57,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's not acceptable.</font>

571
00:24:58,000 --> 00:24:59,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One day. That's all you've got.</font>

572
00:25:00,350 --> 00:25:01,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't print it in a day.</font>

573
00:25:01,790 --> 00:25:02,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd need to get the paper,</font>

574
00:25:02,830 --> 00:25:03,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">adjust the electrotype plates,</font>

575
00:25:03,750 --> 00:25:04,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and match the colors.</font>

576
00:25:04,830 --> 00:25:05,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't do all that.</font>

577
00:25:05,790 --> 00:25:07,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get them to give me a template.</font>

578
00:25:07,350 --> 00:25:08,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With a template, I could do it.</font>

579
00:25:08,550 --> 00:25:10,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where am I supposed to get a template?</font>

580
00:25:10,510 --> 00:25:11,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to take care</font>

581
00:25:11,750 --> 00:25:12,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of these two buyers from Taiwan, China</font>

582
00:25:12,550 --> 00:25:13,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and get the money today.</font>

583
00:25:13,400 --> 00:25:14,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, I'll throw you in the sea.</font>

584
00:25:16,750 --> 00:25:17,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guangzong,</font>

585
00:25:17,440 --> 00:25:18,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">find something valuable here</font>

586
00:25:18,790 --> 00:25:19,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and give it to them.</font>

587
00:25:19,440 --> 00:25:21,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get the cash to save your mom, okay?</font>

588
00:25:22,680 --> 00:25:23,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Useless!</font>

589
00:25:44,350 --> 00:25:45,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I take that back.</font>

590
00:25:45,880 --> 00:25:46,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're a quick thinker.</font>

591
00:25:49,750 --> 00:25:52,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know things have been tight lately.</font>

592
00:25:52,310 --> 00:25:54,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need cash too,
or I wouldn't offer this price.</font>

593
00:25:55,480 --> 00:25:56,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't talk to me about those invoices.</font>

594
00:25:57,070 --> 00:25:58,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're obviously fake.</font>

595
00:25:59,270 --> 00:26:01,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, Yu. It's Guangzong.</font>

596
00:26:02,160 --> 00:26:03,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Guangzong.</font>

597
00:26:04,400 --> 00:26:05,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yu, listen.</font>

598
00:26:06,640 --> 00:26:07,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yu. Yu...</font>

599
00:26:07,960 --> 00:26:09,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've got a batch of invoices.</font>

600
00:26:09,590 --> 00:26:10,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The real deal.</font>

601
00:26:10,880 --> 00:26:12,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even the tax bureau can't tell.</font>

602
00:26:12,350 --> 00:26:14,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I could show my face,</font>

603
00:26:14,310 --> 00:26:16,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd double my money selling them myself.</font>

604
00:26:16,440 --> 00:26:17,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You... don't want them?</font>

605
00:26:18,440 --> 00:26:19,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You actually believe that?</font>

606
00:26:19,720 --> 00:26:21,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All that talk of crackdowns.
Who's been caught?</font>

607
00:26:21,790 --> 00:26:22,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who? Has he?</font>

608
00:26:23,110 --> 00:26:23,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What?</font>

609
00:26:24,510 --> 00:26:25,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You changed businesses?</font>

610
00:26:25,830 --> 00:26:28,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These invoices are as good as gold.</font>

611
00:26:28,830 --> 00:26:29,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you know?</font>

612
00:26:30,240 --> 00:26:31,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're in short supply right now.</font>

613
00:26:31,680 --> 00:26:32,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once supply catches up,</font>

614
00:26:32,750 --> 00:26:34,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">prices will drop.</font>

615
00:26:34,350 --> 00:26:35,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then you'll have missed your chance.</font>

616
00:26:35,750 --> 00:26:37,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll buy them when the price drops?</font>

617
00:26:37,400 --> 00:26:38,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go to hell!</font>

618
00:26:41,400 --> 00:26:43,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By this time tomorrow, bring the money,</font>

619
00:26:44,640 --> 00:26:45,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or come collect your mom.</font>

620
00:26:46,160 --> 00:26:47,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't print it in a day.</font>

621
00:26:47,480 --> 00:26:48,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Find something valuable here</font>

622
00:26:48,790 --> 00:26:49,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and give it to them.</font>

623
00:26:49,480 --> 00:26:51,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get the cash to save your mom, okay?</font>

624
00:26:52,110 --> 00:26:53,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop work. Seal off the island.</font>

625
00:26:53,480 --> 00:26:55,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Burn everything in the warehouse.</font>

626
00:27:07,920 --> 00:27:09,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Li,</font>

627
00:27:10,160 --> 00:27:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what do you say?</font>

628
00:27:12,030 --> 00:27:13,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just call me Li.</font>

629
00:27:14,590 --> 00:27:15,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gentlemen,</font>

630
00:27:15,510 --> 00:27:16,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't know who you were.</font>

631
00:27:16,750 --> 00:27:17,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My apologies.</font>

632
00:27:18,030 --> 00:27:18,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you check our funds?</font>

633
00:27:19,240 --> 00:27:20,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Satisfied?</font>

634
00:27:20,680 --> 00:27:21,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What check?</font>

635
00:27:21,960 --> 00:27:23,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just assessing the risk.</font>

636
00:27:23,880 --> 00:27:25,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How much? Tell me.</font>

637
00:27:25,880 --> 00:27:26,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Five million.</font>

638
00:27:31,960 --> 00:27:33,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Five million?</font>

639
00:27:33,640 --> 00:27:34,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What were you thinking?</font>

640
00:27:36,270 --> 00:27:37,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With so many cards,</font>

641
00:27:37,550 --> 00:27:39,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you brought the one
with the lowest balance.</font>

642
00:27:39,240 --> 00:27:40,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How embarrassing.</font>

643
00:27:40,590 --> 00:27:41,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll give him hell when I get back.</font>

644
00:27:42,790 --> 00:27:43,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Li,</font>

645
00:27:43,920 --> 00:27:45,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you've checked our funds</font>

646
00:27:45,350 --> 00:27:47,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and seen our cards.</font>

647
00:27:47,790 --> 00:27:49,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So what now?</font>

648
00:27:49,240 --> 00:27:50,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gentlemen,</font>

649
00:27:50,400 --> 00:27:51,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think of you as friends.</font>

650
00:27:51,640 --> 00:27:53,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With your resources,</font>

651
00:27:54,240 --> 00:27:56,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why bother with those lousy magazines?</font>

652
00:27:56,510 --> 00:27:58,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have something more valuable here.</font>

653
00:27:58,880 --> 00:28:00,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something more valuable?</font>

654
00:28:00,960 --> 00:28:01,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have a seat, Zhao.</font>

655
00:28:02,240 --> 00:28:03,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me explain.</font>

656
00:28:04,270 --> 00:28:05,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's worth the most these days?</font>

657
00:28:07,480 --> 00:28:08,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Printed invoices.</font>

658
00:28:09,270 --> 00:28:10,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're as good as gold.</font>

659
00:28:11,680 --> 00:28:12,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Invoices?</font>

660
00:28:13,350 --> 00:28:16,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone knows
there's money in invoices.</font>

661
00:28:16,880 --> 00:28:17,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhao,</font>

662
00:28:17,830 --> 00:28:19,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do you think a factory this big</font>

663
00:28:19,510 --> 00:28:20,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just prints calendars</font>

664
00:28:20,590 --> 00:28:21,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and magazines?</font>

665
00:28:22,480 --> 00:28:24,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These are exact copies.</font>

666
00:28:25,030 --> 00:28:26,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And they're in stock.</font>

667
00:28:26,160 --> 00:28:27,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What does it mean?</font>

668
00:28:28,510 --> 00:28:29,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These aren't the cheap fakes</font>

669
00:28:30,000 --> 00:28:31,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you find in back alleys.</font>

670
00:28:31,880 --> 00:28:33,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They come through the right channels.</font>

671
00:28:34,270 --> 00:28:35,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The right channels. Understand?</font>

672
00:28:35,510 --> 00:28:37,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sounds like you have connections.</font>

673
00:28:38,160 --> 00:28:38,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhao gets it.</font>

674
00:28:39,270 --> 00:28:40,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On the mainland,</font>

675
00:28:40,720 --> 00:28:42,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the right connections guarantee quality.</font>

676
00:28:43,030 --> 00:28:43,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me put it this way.</font>

677
00:28:44,400 --> 00:28:46,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With the right person's approval,</font>

678
00:28:47,000 --> 00:28:47,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">these invoices</font>

679
00:28:48,830 --> 00:28:50,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can fool even the tax bureau.</font>

680
00:28:51,720 --> 00:28:53,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They can fool the tax bureau?</font>

681
00:28:53,480 --> 00:28:54,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're that good?</font>

682
00:28:58,680 --> 00:28:59,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mao,</font>

683
00:29:00,960 --> 00:29:02,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">after all that's happened,</font>

684
00:29:02,550 --> 00:29:03,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's hard to trust you again.</font>

685
00:29:04,200 --> 00:29:04,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I understand.</font>

686
00:29:05,200 --> 00:29:06,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This person you mentioned,</font>

687
00:29:06,830 --> 00:29:07,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who is it?</font>

688
00:29:09,720 --> 00:29:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave that to me.</font>

689
00:29:11,350 --> 00:29:12,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We each make money our own way.</font>

690
00:29:14,640 --> 00:29:16,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You stopped talking</font>

691
00:29:16,440 --> 00:29:17,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when it came to the best part.</font>

692
00:29:18,160 --> 00:29:19,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How are we supposed to trust you?</font>

693
00:29:20,550 --> 00:29:21,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides,</font>

694
00:29:22,310 --> 00:29:24,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if we pay for these invoices,</font>

695
00:29:24,920 --> 00:29:26,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how do we sell them on?</font>

696
00:29:26,960 --> 00:29:28,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry about selling them.</font>

697
00:29:28,680 --> 00:29:29,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These invoices</font>

698
00:29:29,590 --> 00:29:31,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are in huge demand across the country.</font>

699
00:29:31,750 --> 00:29:33,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The question is whether
you've got the guts.</font>

700
00:29:34,920 --> 00:29:35,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you dare?</font>

701
00:29:42,240 --> 00:29:42,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's the deal.</font>

702
00:29:44,720 --> 00:29:45,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get us off this island.</font>

703
00:29:46,680 --> 00:29:47,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once we're ashore,</font>

704
00:29:48,270 --> 00:29:50,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll pay when you give me the goods.</font>

705
00:29:52,030 --> 00:29:52,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No problem.</font>

706
00:29:53,920 --> 00:29:55,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Based on Ouyang's description
of the area,</font>

707
00:29:55,550 --> 00:29:56,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I got power company records for</font>

708
00:29:56,750 --> 00:29:58,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">nearby businesses
with unusual electricity use.</font>

709
00:29:58,830 --> 00:30:00,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's a lot to go through,</font>

710
00:30:00,400 --> 00:30:02,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but we have no choice.</font>

711
00:30:02,480 --> 00:30:04,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I promised in writing</font>

712
00:30:04,070 --> 00:30:06,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to return them before work
tomorrow morning.</font>

713
00:30:06,830 --> 00:30:07,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tomorrow morning?</font>

714
00:30:08,240 --> 00:30:09,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How is that possible?</font>

715
00:30:09,750 --> 00:30:10,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right.</font>

716
00:30:10,640 --> 00:30:12,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's up to us to find Xu.</font>

717
00:30:12,750 --> 00:30:13,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's get started.</font>

718
00:30:28,960 --> 00:30:29,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Captain Zhang,</font>

719
00:30:30,680 --> 00:30:31,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will you sit down?</font>

720
00:30:31,960 --> 00:30:33,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't sit still.</font>

721
00:30:34,750 --> 00:30:36,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Try not to worry, okay?</font>

722
00:30:36,440 --> 00:30:38,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All our officers are on standby.</font>

723
00:30:38,400 --> 00:30:39,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once we confirm</font>

724
00:30:39,160 --> 00:30:41,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">exactly where Ouyang Xu
and Yan Ping'an are,</font>

725
00:30:41,030 --> 00:30:42,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'll head out immediately.</font>

726
00:30:42,240 --> 00:30:43,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No matter what,</font>

727
00:30:43,350 --> 00:30:45,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we must take part in this operation.</font>

728
00:30:45,310 --> 00:30:46,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's likely to be</font>

729
00:30:46,270 --> 00:30:47,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">direct evidence</font>

730
00:30:47,070 --> 00:30:48,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of counterfeiting at the scene.</font>

731
00:30:48,510 --> 00:30:50,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This counterfeiting operation</font>

732
00:30:50,240 --> 00:30:51,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is far more complex than</font>

733
00:30:51,750 --> 00:30:52,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Linjia Village case.</font>

734
00:30:52,790 --> 00:30:53,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's very likely</font>

735
00:30:53,960 --> 00:30:55,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'll encounter armed resistance.</font>

736
00:30:55,640 --> 00:30:56,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anything could go wrong</font>

737
00:30:56,480 --> 00:30:57,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at any moment.</font>

738
00:30:58,030 --> 00:30:59,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You tax officers</font>

739
00:30:59,510 --> 00:31:01,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't have field experience.</font>

740
00:31:01,400 --> 00:31:02,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For safety reasons,</font>

741
00:31:02,920 --> 00:31:04,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you should sit this operation out.</font>

742
00:31:05,000 --> 00:31:06,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But tax crimes now</font>

743
00:31:06,440 --> 00:31:08,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can carry the death penalty.</font>

744
00:31:08,590 --> 00:31:09,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That makes these criminals</font>

745
00:31:09,590 --> 00:31:11,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">even more desperate.</font>

746
00:31:13,440 --> 00:31:14,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Director Shen,</font>

747
00:31:14,880 --> 00:31:16,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm a tax officer,</font>

748
00:31:16,750 --> 00:31:18,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I used to be a soldier.</font>

749
00:31:18,790 --> 00:31:20,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Trust me.</font>

750
00:31:20,480 --> 00:31:21,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And trust</font>

751
00:31:21,750 --> 00:31:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the people I trained.</font>

752
00:31:24,400 --> 00:31:26,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is a steel-processing factory.</font>

753
00:31:27,000 --> 00:31:28,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's located on an island
near the eastern suburbs.</font>

754
00:31:29,350 --> 00:31:30,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was shut down for a long time</font>

755
00:31:30,720 --> 00:31:32,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to address pollution violations.</font>

756
00:31:32,480 --> 00:31:34,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But recently, its electricity use</font>

757
00:31:34,110 --> 00:31:35,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has shot up.</font>

758
00:31:36,160 --> 00:31:37,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Judging from the data,</font>

759
00:31:37,240 --> 00:31:38,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's running almost 24 hours a day.</font>

760
00:31:39,200 --> 00:31:39,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something's wrong.</font>

761
00:31:40,350 --> 00:31:41,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The bureau of industry and commerce
has confirmed it.</font>

762
00:31:41,960 --> 00:31:42,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The figures come from</font>

763
00:31:42,510 --> 00:31:43,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the island's electrical substation.</font>

764
00:31:44,270 --> 00:31:46,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The surroundings match
Ouyang's description.</font>

765
00:31:47,960 --> 00:31:49,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Xinlong Wire Drawing Factory]</font>

766
00:31:49,750 --> 00:31:51,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Early this morning, the typhoon</font>

767
00:31:51,200 --> 00:31:52,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">entered China's eastern waters.</font>

768
00:31:53,070 --> 00:31:54,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It will continue moving south.</font>

769
00:31:54,550 --> 00:31:55,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As a result,</font>

770
00:31:55,830 --> 00:31:57,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xinwu, in the storm's path,</font>

771
00:31:57,680 --> 00:32:00,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and southeastern cities
like Miyang and Chunjiang</font>

772
00:32:00,590 --> 00:32:01,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will see heavy rainstorms.</font>

773
00:32:05,400 --> 00:32:05,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello?</font>

774
00:32:06,200 --> 00:32:07,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you having fun?</font>

775
00:32:07,590 --> 00:32:08,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong,</font>

776
00:32:08,160 --> 00:32:09,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm getting ready</font>

777
00:32:09,310 --> 00:32:10,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to burn those goods.</font>

778
00:32:13,480 --> 00:32:15,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've worked for me for years.</font>

779
00:32:16,830 --> 00:32:17,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's my fault</font>

780
00:32:18,790 --> 00:32:19,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't teach you better.</font>

781
00:32:20,240 --> 00:32:22,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong, I'm really in trouble.</font>

782
00:32:22,550 --> 00:32:23,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep pretending.</font>

783
00:32:23,240 --> 00:32:23,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That shipment of yours...</font>

784
00:32:24,000 --> 00:32:25,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're still lying to me.</font>

785
00:32:25,510 --> 00:32:26,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those two men you brought there,</font>

786
00:32:26,960 --> 00:32:28,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">one's a cop. The other's a tax officer.</font>

787
00:32:29,680 --> 00:32:31,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They caught Lin Jianye.</font>

788
00:32:33,400 --> 00:32:34,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You dug your own grave.</font>

789
00:32:37,110 --> 00:32:38,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're on your own now.</font>

790
00:32:38,680 --> 00:32:40,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong, tell me the truth.</font>

791
00:32:42,440 --> 00:32:43,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you already know</font>

792
00:32:43,640 --> 00:32:45,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Lin Jianye would be sentenced to death?</font>

793
00:32:46,110 --> 00:32:48,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When you told me to seal off
the island and sell the goods,</font>

794
00:32:48,640 --> 00:32:49,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you already knew,</font>

795
00:32:49,680 --> 00:32:50,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">didn't you?</font>

796
00:32:51,880 --> 00:32:52,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Ahong,</font>

797
00:32:54,030 --> 00:32:55,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have you ever truly cared about me?</font>

798
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:57,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What am I to you?</font>

799
00:33:07,350 --> 00:33:08,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those two men you brought here,</font>

800
00:33:08,790 --> 00:33:10,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">one's a cop. The other's a tax officer.</font>

801
00:33:16,480 --> 00:33:17,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your goods</font>

802
00:33:17,960 --> 00:33:19,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wouldn't sell in the Golden Triangle.</font>

803
00:33:19,680 --> 00:33:22,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go. He's just a middleman.</font>

804
00:33:22,590 --> 00:33:23,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tomorrow!</font>

805
00:33:24,400 --> 00:33:25,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tomorrow, I'll take you to the factory.</font>

806
00:33:26,030 --> 00:33:27,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This Mr. Zhou of yours</font>

807
00:33:27,790 --> 00:33:29,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">doubled the price.</font>

808
00:33:31,310 --> 00:33:32,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can negotiate.</font>

809
00:33:33,920 --> 00:33:36,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, speak up a little.</font>

810
00:33:36,590 --> 00:33:37,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm surrounded by water.</font>

811
00:33:38,070 --> 00:33:39,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The signal's terrible.</font>

812
00:33:40,440 --> 00:33:41,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you dare?</font>

813
00:33:42,480 --> 00:33:44,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's the deal.
Get us off this island.</font>

814
00:33:45,440 --> 00:33:46,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once we're ashore,</font>

815
00:33:47,270 --> 00:33:49,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll pay when you give me the goods.</font>

816
00:34:04,880 --> 00:34:05,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get lost.</font>

817
00:34:09,630 --> 00:34:11,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay, got it.</font>

818
00:34:15,070 --> 00:34:15,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm busy.</font>

819
00:34:15,880 --> 00:34:16,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll talk to you later.</font>

820
00:34:21,920 --> 00:34:22,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guangzong.</font>

821
00:34:24,360 --> 00:34:25,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened?</font>

822
00:34:37,280 --> 00:34:37,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey.</font>

823
00:34:44,150 --> 00:34:44,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two.</font>

824
00:34:45,550 --> 00:34:47,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Finish off whoever needs finishing off.</font>

825
00:34:49,150 --> 00:34:50,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come see me if you survive.</font>

826
00:34:52,440 --> 00:34:53,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Liu,</font>

827
00:34:55,110 --> 00:34:56,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you in such a hurry
to finish me off?</font>

828
00:35:05,800 --> 00:35:07,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ahong found out herself.</font>

829
00:35:11,190 --> 00:35:12,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is the key?</font>

830
00:35:14,800 --> 00:35:16,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I give it to you,</font>

831
00:35:17,360 --> 00:35:18,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will you let me live?</font>

832
00:35:19,630 --> 00:35:20,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cut the crap.</font>

833
00:35:22,150 --> 00:35:23,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll talk, I'll talk.</font>

834
00:35:24,110 --> 00:35:24,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want the invoices.</font>

835
00:35:26,000 --> 00:35:26,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to live.</font>

836
00:35:27,150 --> 00:35:27,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Spare my life.</font>

837
00:35:29,280 --> 00:35:30,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The key...</font>

838
00:35:31,710 --> 00:35:32,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The key is in the cabinet.</font>

839
00:35:33,070 --> 00:35:35,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You already know the code.</font>

840
00:37:10,630 --> 00:37:11,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou.</font>

841
00:37:12,480 --> 00:37:13,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou.</font>

842
00:37:14,710 --> 00:37:15,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just follow my lead.</font>

843
00:37:21,670 --> 00:37:22,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gentlemen.</font>

844
00:37:24,110 --> 00:37:25,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou is coming, too?</font>

845
00:37:25,630 --> 00:37:26,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's one of us.</font>

846
00:37:27,590 --> 00:37:28,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you rest well?</font>

847
00:37:28,920 --> 00:37:30,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not bad.</font>

848
00:37:30,920 --> 00:37:33,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Li, the tide's coming in.
Time to go.</font>

849
00:37:33,800 --> 00:37:36,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gentlemen, please get aboard.</font>

850
00:37:48,510 --> 00:37:49,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep heading out to sea.</font>

851
00:37:50,070 --> 00:37:51,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't stop unless I say so.</font>

852
00:37:53,800 --> 00:37:55,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hey, Tou.</font>

853
00:37:57,030 --> 00:37:57,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See you later.</font>

854
00:38:07,320 --> 00:38:09,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Chunjiang Tax Bureau]</font>

855
00:38:34,550 --> 00:38:35,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something's off.</font>

856
00:38:35,960 --> 00:38:36,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're going the wrong way.</font>

857
00:38:49,030 --> 00:38:50,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which one of you is the taxman?</font>

858
00:38:50,400 --> 00:38:51,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which one is the cop?</font>

859
00:38:54,320 --> 00:38:55,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you.</font>

860
00:38:55,670 --> 00:38:57,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Playing mind games with me, huh?</font>

861
00:38:57,960 --> 00:38:58,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Guangzong.</font>

862
00:38:59,670 --> 00:39:00,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just put the gun down.</font>

863
00:39:00,670 --> 00:39:02,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not too late yet.</font>

864
00:39:02,710 --> 00:39:03,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't make things worse.</font>

865
00:39:04,590 --> 00:39:05,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So you're the cop, huh?</font>

866
00:39:06,150 --> 00:39:07,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You talk pretty tough.</font>

867
00:39:07,760 --> 00:39:09,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll blow your head off.</font>

868
00:39:09,110 --> 00:39:09,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Guangzong.</font>

869
00:39:09,800 --> 00:39:10,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One shot can only kill one of us.</font>

870
00:39:11,510 --> 00:39:13,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The other two will still
drag you ashore.</font>

871
00:39:13,880 --> 00:39:14,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Two?</font>

872
00:39:16,030 --> 00:39:16,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou Haiyang!</font>

873
00:39:17,590 --> 00:39:18,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here!</font>

874
00:39:20,400 --> 00:39:21,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come here!</font>

875
00:39:23,630 --> 00:39:24,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou Haiyang!</font>

876
00:39:25,400 --> 00:39:27,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's got the gun now?</font>

877
00:39:30,280 --> 00:39:32,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And who can get you to Hong Kong, China?</font>

878
00:39:33,150 --> 00:39:34,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You think this cop can?</font>

879
00:39:34,800 --> 00:39:36,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Or this taxman?</font>

880
00:39:41,110 --> 00:39:42,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me remind you.</font>

881
00:39:43,190 --> 00:39:44,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">About these invoices,</font>

882
00:39:44,510 --> 00:39:45,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you made the paper,</font>

883
00:39:45,840 --> 00:39:47,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you made the ink, too.</font>

884
00:39:47,710 --> 00:39:49,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They'll just have you shot.</font>

885
00:39:50,480 --> 00:39:51,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think it through.</font>

886
00:39:52,000 --> 00:39:53,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take out the cop.</font>

887
00:39:55,510 --> 00:39:57,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You take out this taxman</font>

888
00:39:57,360 --> 00:39:58,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you're my brother.</font>

889
00:39:58,840 --> 00:40:00,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll split the invoices fifty-fifty.</font>

890
00:40:01,150 --> 00:40:02,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm a man of my word.</font>

891
00:40:02,840 --> 00:40:03,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think it through.</font>

892
00:40:11,000 --> 00:40:11,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhou Haiyang.</font>

893
